{"articleNo":"2573","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2573&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 타대학(안동대학교) 수학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.22","hit":"13512","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청서 및 안동대수학허가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2573&attachNo=1876"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;안동대학교 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 지원자격 : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 본교 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 수학기간 : 타대학에서 2개 학기(1년) 이내로 수학 가능.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출서류 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 제출서류(첨부파일)&nbsp;: 타대학 수학 신청원, 수학허가신청서(안동대학교)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 제출장소 : 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청기한 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 7. 26(월)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 수학기간 : 2010. 9. 1(수) ~ 12. 17(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 등록금 납부 : 소속대학교에 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 수강신청 : 추천서류에 의거 안동대학교 학사관리과에서 일괄 신청.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 개설과목 및 수업시간표 조회<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">안동대학교 홈페이지 종합정보시스템</span></a><a href=\"http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/)\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/)</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →손님으로 입장 → 개설교과목 조회 (2010학년도 2학기)</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9. 취득학점 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학기당 18학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 122.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -122.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10. 학점인정 : 수학기간 중 취득한 학점은 우리대학교 학칙, 수강신청 및 성적처리에 관한 규정 등에 의거 동일하게 처리한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11. 기타<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◆&nbsp; 문의사항&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 안동대학교 학사관리과(054-820-7034)</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 종합학사행정실 (각관 1층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (테크노관 478-7359 / 디지털관&nbsp; 478-7751&nbsp; / 글로벌관 478-7598)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010.&nbsp;&nbsp; 7.&nbsp;&nbsp; 22.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교무연구과장</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
